WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.466
Anthropic's new GitHub agents can

00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:04.122
approve your pull requests.

00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:05.426
Set them up wrong,

00:00:05.226 --> 00:00:06.803
and nobody else ever looks.

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:10.075
Claude Ship launched on November twenty-third.

00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:11.652
Its agents take a pull

00:00:11.452 --> 00:00:13.339
request from first review to

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:14.605
an approval decision.

00:00:15.155 --> 00:00:17.767
Code Review ranks findings by severity.

00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:19.326
Steward pushes fixes,

00:00:19.126 --> 00:00:20.331
but never approves.

00:00:20.371 --> 00:00:22.497
Approvals follows a policy file

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:23.116
you commit.

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:25.578
That file sets rules by path.

00:00:25.618 --> 00:00:27.438
Billing code might need two

00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:29.410
humans, and test fixtures just

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.030
one, after review passes.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.834
Anthropic's own docs list the gaps.

00:00:33.874 --> 00:00:36.233
The check blocks nothing unless required.

00:00:36.273 --> 00:00:37.791
The author can fill the

00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:38.346
only seat.

00:00:38.386 --> 00:00:40.131
Pull request text can steer

00:00:39.931 --> 00:00:40.938
a classifier.

00:00:41.488 --> 00:00:43.265
Start with Code Review on

00:00:43.065 --> 00:00:44.241
one repository.

00:00:44.281 --> 00:00:46.636
Run Approvals in observe mode first.

00:00:46.676 --> 00:00:48.993
Before enforcing, require a human

00:00:48.793 --> 00:00:50.117
who is not the author.

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.896
Everything is billed by tokens,

00:00:52.696 --> 00:00:53.946
even observe mode.

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:56.846
Eligible Enterprise organizations can claim

00:00:56.646 --> 00:00:58.552
at least ten thousand dollars

00:00:58.352 --> 00:00:59.166
in credits.

00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:02.089
Anthropic says merged pull requests

00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:03.491
more than doubled on its

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.963
own team, and the share

00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:06.716
of reverted changes fell over

00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:07.557
forty percent.

00:01:07.597 --> 00:01:09.750
Nobody has checked that independently.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.814
Review is how a second

00:01:11.614 --> 00:01:13.543
person agrees to own a change.

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.387
Write the policy loosely,

00:01:15.187 --> 00:01:16.590
and the only reader of

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:17.860
payment code may be the

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.929
model that wrote it.

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.004
The full story has every

00:01:20.804 --> 00:01:22.593
setting and the safe rollout.

